{"suttaId":"sn35.33-42","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-iv","vriCode":"s0304m.mul","paras":[127,140],"vripara":"33"},"segments":{"sn35.33:0.3":"1-10. Jātidhammādisuttadasakaṃ","sn35.33:1.1":"Sāvatthinidānaṃ.","sn35.33:1.2":"Tatra kho … pe …“sabbaṃ, bhikkhave, jātidhammaṃ.","sn35.33:1.4":"Kiñca, bhikkhave, sabbaṃ jātidhammaṃ?","sn35.33:1.5":"Cakkhu, bhikkhave, jātidhammaṃ.","sn35.33:1.6":"Rūpā … cakkhuviññāṇaṃ … cakkhusamphasso jātidhammo.","sn35.33:1.9":"Yampidaṃ cakkhusamphassapaccayā uppajjati vedayitaṃ sukhaṃ vā dukkhaṃ vā adukkhamasukhaṃ vā tampi jātidhammaṃ … pe … jivhā … rasā … jivhāviññāṇaṃ … jivhāsamphasso … yampidaṃ jivhāsamphassapaccayā uppajjati vedayitaṃ sukhaṃ vā dukkhaṃ vā adukkhamasukhaṃ vā tampi jātidhammaṃ.","sn35.33:1.15":"Kāyo … pe.","sn35.33:1.16":".. mano jātidhammo, dhammā jātidhammā, manoviññāṇaṃ jātidhammaṃ, manosamphasso jātidhammo.","sn35.33:1.17":"Yampidaṃ manosamphassapaccayā uppajjati vedayitaṃ sukhaṃ vā dukkhaṃ vā adukkhamasukhaṃ vā tampi jātidhammaṃ.","sn35.33:1.18":"Evaṃ passaṃ, bhikkhave, sutavā ariyasāvako cakkhusmimpi nibbindati, rūpesupi … cakkhuviññāṇepi … cakkhusamphassepi … pe … nāparaṃ itthattāyāti pajānātī”ti.","sn35.33:1.20":"Paṭhamaṃ.","sn35.34:1.1":"“Sabbaṃ, bhikkhave, jarādhammaṃ … pe … saṃkhittaṃ.","sn35.34:1.3":"Dutiyaṃ.","sn35.35:1.1":"“Sabbaṃ, bhikkhave, byādhidhammaṃ … pe ….","sn35.35:1.3":"Tatiyaṃ.","sn35.36:1.1":"“Sabbaṃ, bhikkhave, maraṇadhammaṃ … pe ….","sn35.36:1.3":"Catutthaṃ.","sn35.37:1.1":"“Sabbaṃ, bhikkhave, sokadhammaṃ … pe ….","sn35.37:1.3":"Pañcamaṃ.","sn35.38:1.1":"“Sabbaṃ, bhikkhave, saṃkilesikadhammaṃ … pe ….","sn35.38:1.3":"Chaṭṭhaṃ.","sn35.39:1.1":"“Sabbaṃ, bhikkhave, khayadhammaṃ … pe ….","sn35.39:1.2":"Sattamaṃ.","sn35.40:1.1":"“Sabbaṃ, bhikkhave, vayadhammaṃ … pe ….","sn35.40:1.3":"Aṭṭhamaṃ.","sn35.41:1.1":"“Sabbaṃ, bhikkhave, samudayadhammaṃ … pe ….","sn35.41:1.3":"Navamaṃ.","sn35.42:1.1":"“Sabbaṃ, bhikkhave, nirodhadhammaṃ … pe ….","sn35.42:1.3":"Dasamaṃ.","sn35.42:1.4":"Jātidhammavaggo catuttho.","sn35.42:2.0":"Tassuddānaṃ –","sn35.42:2.1":"Jātijarābyādhimaraṇaṃ, soko ca saṃkilesikaṃ;","sn35.42:2.3":"Khayavayasamudayaṃ, nirodhadhammena te dasāti."},"attha":{"book":"Spk-iv","bookName":"Saḷāyatanavagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0304a.att","from":64,"to":64,"paras":[{"para":64,"vripara":"33-42","refs":["sn35.33"],"lines":["33-42. Jātidhammavagge <b>jātidhamman</b>ti jāyanadhammaṃ nibbattanasabhāvaṃ.","<b>Jarādhamman</b>ti jīraṇasabhāvaṃ.","<b>Byādhidhamman</b>ti byādhino uppattipaccayabhāvena byādhisabhāvaṃ.","<b>Maraṇadhamman</b>ti maraṇasabhāvaṃ.","<b>Sokadhamman</b>ti sokassa uppattipaccayabhāvena sokasabhāvaṃ.","<b>Saṃkilesikadhamman</b>ti saṃkilesikasabhāvaṃ.","<b>Khayadhamman</b>ti khayagamanasabhāvaṃ.","<b>Vayadhammā</b> dīsupi eseva nayoti."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.33"],["sn35.33"],["sn35.33"],["sn35.33"],["sn35.33"],["sn35.33"],["sn35.33"],["sn35.33"]]}],"wordLinks":[["sn35.33:1.2","jātidhammaṃ",0,0],["sn35.33:1.4","jātidhammaṃ",0,0],["sn35.33:1.5","jātidhammaṃ",0,0],["sn35.33:1.9","jātidhammaṃ",0,0],["sn35.33:1.16","jātidhammaṃ",0,0],["sn35.33:1.17","jātidhammaṃ",0,0]],"before":[{"para":62,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sabbavaggo tatiyo."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":63,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Jātidhammavaggavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[[]]}]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-iv","bookName":"Saḷāyatanavagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0304t.tik","from":73,"to":75,"paras":[{"para":73,"vripara":"33-42","refs":["sn35.33"],"lines":["33-42. <b>Nibbattanasabhāvan</b>ti hetupaccayehi uppajjanasabhāvaṃ.","Uppādānantaraṃ buddhippattiyā <b>jīraṇasabhāvaṃ</b>.","Yattha cakkhādayo, tattheva visabhāgasamuṭṭhānalakkhaṇena byādhino <b>uppattipaccayabhāvena byādhisabhāvaṃ.</b>","<b>Maraṇasabhāvan</b>ti vināsasabhāvaṃ.","<b>Sokasabhāvan</b>ti ñātibyasanādinā ḍayhamānadukkhasabhāvaṃ.","<b>Saṃkilesikasabhāvan</b>ti taṇhādivasena saṃkilissanasabhāvaṃ."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.33"],["sn35.33"],["sn35.33"],["sn35.33"],["sn35.33"],["sn35.33"]]},{"para":74,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.33"],"lines":["Jātidhammavaggavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.33"]]},{"para":75,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.33"],"lines":["Sabbaaniccavaggavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn35.33"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
